cenario tests plotting-auditor failing maxAuditorRetries (3) times and escalating to blocked. This is partially covered by TEST-005 (worldbuilding convergence exhaustion) since the pattern is identical. Could be added as P2 in a future cycle.\\n- **Character convergence exhaustion**: Same as above for character phase. Lower priority since TEST-024 already covers the retry path and TEST-005 covers the exhaustion pattern.\\nMARKDOWN_EOF\\n\", \"description\": \"Write output.md\", \"initial_wait\": 10}"
