nstrate the value of the dual-perspective audit beyond structural validation.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Architecture Health Assessment\\n\\n**Overall: Good (B+)**\\n\\nThe system has sound pipeline architecture, consistent hierarchy, proper convergence bounds, and comprehensive invariant coverage. The remaining issues are in documentation consistency, adversarial enforcement completeness, and retry mechanism clarity. No issues threaten fundamental correctness — they affect quality assurance depth and documentation accuracy.\\nOUTPUT_MARKER_EOF\\necho \\\"Output written successfully\\\"\", \"description\": \"Write output.md narrative\", \"initial_wait\": 10, \"shellId\": \"writeOutput\"}"
