Gap hunting cycle 2 found 6 warning gaps that were fixed:
1. AC-004: Schema protocol — artifact-schemas.json lacked explicit protocol field on each schema
2. AC-005: draft.md protocol — draft.md schema had no protocol for read-modify-write
3. CR-002: Ghost agent — an agent referenced in routing but missing from roster
