rdinator routing tables (concept, worldbuilding, drafting, beta-reading) for result code consistency with roster declarations.\\\",\\n      \\\"itemsChecked\\\": 152,\\n      \\\"gapsFound\\\": 2,\\n      \\\"gaps\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"id\\\": \\\"CR-004\\\",\\n          \\\"severity\\\": \\\"warning\\\",\\n          \\\"description\\\": \\\"architecture.json foreshadowing-ledger.json readers array includes 'plot-architect' — this agent was dissolved into 5 specialists (structure-selector, dual-arc-builder, tension-mapper, chapter-outliner, scene-beat-designer) during depth analysis. 'romantic-fantasy-writer-plot-architect' does not exist in roster.json. Same root cause as cycle 2 CR-002 but in a different location (architecture.json readers vs. craft-profile.schema.md writers). The appropriate reader replacement is likely 'craft-tracker' or 'tension-mapper' given the foreshadowing domain.\\\",\\n          \\\"file\\\": \\\".fractal-factory/architecture.json\\\",\\n          \\\"location\\\": \\\"artifacts.crossCutting foreshadowing-ledger.json readers array\\\",\\n          \\\"expected\\\": \\\"A reader name that maps to an agent in roster.json\\\",\\n          \\\"actual\\\": \\\"\\\\\\\"plot-architect\\\\\\\" — agent does not exist in roster\\\"\\n        },\\n        {\\n          \\\"id\\\": \\\"CR-005\\\",\\n          \\\"severity\\\": \\\"warning\\\",\\n          \\\"description\\\": \\\"architecture.json mystery-box-inventory.json readers array includes 'plot-architect' — same dangling reference as CR-004. 'romantic-fantasy-writer-plot-architect' does not exist in roster.json. The appropriate reader replacement is likely 'tension-mapper' or 'chapter-outliner' given the mystery-box/engagement domain.\\\",\\n          \\\"file\\\": \\\".fractal-factory/architecture.json\\\",\\n          \\\"location\\\": \\\"artifacts.crossCutting mystery-box-inventory.json readers array\\\",\\n          \\\"expected\\\": \\\"A reader name that maps to an agent i