2. **Context signals**: `.fractal-factory/synthesis-signals/context-signals.json` — 14 process-level signals (9-10 high, 4-5 medium)

## Meta-Knowledge Store Location
- `.fractal-factory/meta/` directory
- Knowledge brief at `.fractal-factory/knowledge-brief.json`

## Integration Rules
1. Read both signal files
2. Quality-gate: only integrate signals with sufficient strength and evidence
3. Organize by category (domain signals go under craft domain, process signals go under factory operations)
4. Write integrated knowledge to the meta store
5. Update knowledge-brief.json if it exists

## Output Contract
Write your status to: `.fractal-factory/agents/fractal-factory-knowledge-integrator/status.json`
Prepend an entry to: `.fractal-factory/manifest.json`

Status must include:
- result: "integrated" or "no-new-entries"
- summary describing what was integrated

Do NOT use ask_questions or request human input. Work autonomously.
